{"seq":1,"slug":"preclinical-model-validation","title":"博士转化医学 — 临床前模型验证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/bench-to-bedside/preclinical-model-validation","wordCount":1896,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士转化医学-临床前模型验证\">博士转化医学 — 临床前模型验证</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>临床前模型是转化研究的起点——它们为候选疗法进入人体试验之前提供疗效和安全性的初步证据。然而，临床前模型对人体反应的预测能力长期令人失望：超过 90% 在动物实验中有效的肿瘤药物最终未能通过 III 期临床试验。这种&quot;转化失败&quot;的核心原因在于模型的生理相关性不足和验证方法学的缺失。</p>\n<p>当代临床前模型平台可按生理复杂度排列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型平台</th>\n<th>生理复杂度</th>\n<th>通量</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>人体预测效度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二维细胞系</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>有限（缺乏微环境）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>患者来源类器官（PDO）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中-高（保留组织架构）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>器官芯片（OoC）</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高（多器官串联）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>患者来源异种移植（PDX）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高（保留异质性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转基因动物模型（GEM）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>高（免疫完整）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非人灵长类（NHP）</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>最高（生物相似性）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择模型的核心原则不是追求最高复杂度，而是根据研究问题选择最具信息量的平台——&quot;fit-for-purpose&quot;原则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[研究问题定义] --&gt; B{关键属性需求}&#10;    B --&gt;|靶点验证| C[基因工程细胞系&lt;br/&gt;CRISPR 敲除]&#10;    B --&gt;|药效学评估| D[PDO 类器官&lt;br/&gt;药物敏感性]&#10;    B --&gt;|ADME/毒性| E[器官芯片&lt;br/&gt;肝-肾-心串联]&#10;    B --&gt;|肿瘤异质性| F[PDX 模型&lt;br/&gt;患者来源]&#10;    B --&gt;|免疫反应| G[人源化小鼠&lt;br/&gt;或 GEM 模型]&#10;    C --&gt; H[转化预测效度评估]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[研究问题定义] --&gt; B{关键属性需求}\n    B --&gt;|靶点验证| C[基因工程细胞系&lt;br/&gt;CRISPR 敲除]\n    B --&gt;|药效学评估| D[PDO 类器官&lt;br/&gt;药物敏感性]\n    B --&gt;|ADME/毒性| E[器官芯片&lt;br/&gt;肝-肾-心串联]\n    B --&gt;|肿瘤异质性| F[PDX 模型&lt;br/&gt;患者来源]\n    B --&gt;|免疫反应| G[人源化小鼠&lt;br/&gt;或 GEM 模型]\n    C --&gt; H[转化预测效度评估]\n    D --&gt; H\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"类器官-架桥基础与临床\">类器官：架桥基础与临床</h3><p>类器官（Organoid）是从干细胞或原代组织在三维基质中培养形成的自组织微型器官结构。与传统二维细胞系相比，类器官保留了原始组织的细胞类型多样性、空间组织和部分功能特征。</p>\n<p><strong>类器官在转化研究中的核心应用</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>药物敏感性预测</strong>：肿瘤类器官药物反应与患者临床反应的一致率可达 70-80%（Vlachogiannis et al., Science 2018）。活体生物库（Living Biobank）策略允许在数周内建立患者来源类器官并完成药物筛选</li>\n<li><strong>疾病建模</strong>：CRISPR 编辑正常类器官引入驱动突变，可在等基因背景下研究突变的功能后果</li>\n<li><strong>基因治疗载体评价</strong>：肠道类器官是评估囊性纤维化基因治疗效果的关键平台</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>类器官的转化局限</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>缺乏血管系统和免疫微环境</li>\n<li>培养条件中的生长因子可能改变细胞行为</li>\n<li>建系成功率因组织类型差异较大（结直肠 &gt;80%，胰腺 ~60%）</li>\n<li>缺乏标准化的培养和评价方案</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"器官芯片-工程化的生理模型\">器官芯片：工程化的生理模型</h3><p>器官芯片（Organ-on-a-Chip, OoC）利用微流控技术在芯片上重建器官的微尺度生理功能。通过微通道、可渗透膜和机械刺激（如呼吸运动、蠕动），OoC 模拟了器官的物理微环境。</p>\n<p><strong>关键技术特征</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流体剪切力模拟血流动力学</li>\n<li>气-液界面重建肺泡屏障</li>\n<li>多器官串联（Multi-OoC）模拟全身药代动力学</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>organ</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>in</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>organ</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>int</mtext></msub></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>organ</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dC_{\\text{organ}}}{dt} = \\frac{Q}{V}(C_{\\text{in}} - C_{\\text{organ}}) - \\frac{CL_{\\text{int}}}{V} \\cdot C_{\\text{organ}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">organ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">organ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">int</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">organ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是灌注流速，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是器官室体积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是药物浓度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>int</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CL_{\\text{int}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">int</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是固有清除率。多器官串联时，各室通过循环回路连接，模拟全身暴露。</p>\n<p>FDA 现代化法案 2.0（FDA Modernization Act 2.0, 2022）明确允许使用 OoC 等替代方法代替动物试验提交 IND 申请，标志着监管层面对新模型的正式认可。</p>\n<h3 id=\"患者来源异种移植-pdx-模型\">患者来源异种移植（PDX）模型</h3><p>PDX 模型将患者肿瘤组织直接植入免疫缺陷小鼠皮下或原位，保留了原始肿瘤的基因组异质性、组织架构和部分微环境。</p>\n<p><strong>PDX 在转化研究中的角色</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应用</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共临床试验（Co-clinical）</td>\n<td>同步在患者和 PDX 中评估治疗</td>\n<td>实时验证耐药机制</td>\n<td>时间窗匹配困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>群体 PDX 试验（Mouse Avatar）</td>\n<td>为每位患者建立 PDX，个体化筛药</td>\n<td>理论上最精准</td>\n<td>建模耗时 3-6 月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PDX 药理学平台</td>\n<td>大规模 PDX 库 + 高通量筛选</td>\n<td>覆盖异质性</td>\n<td>缺乏免疫微环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>人源化 PDX</strong>通过植入人源 CD34+ 造血干细胞重建人免疫系统，部分克服了免疫缺失问题，但嵌合效率和 GVHD 风险仍是限制因素。</p>\n<h3 id=\"转化预测效度的量化评估\">转化预测效度的量化评估</h3><p>选择临床前模型后，需要系统评估其对人体反应的预测能力。关键指标包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>阳性预测值（PPV）</strong>：模型中有效的化合物在人体中也有效的概率</li>\n<li><strong>阴性预测值（NPV）</strong>：模型中无效的化合物在人体中也无效的概率</li>\n<li><strong>药理学转化系数</strong>：模型中的有效浓度与人体中的有效暴露量之比</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>转化系数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>human</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>model</mtext></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{转化系数} = \\frac{EC_{50,\\text{human}}}{EC_{50,\\text{model}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">转化系数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">human</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>理想的转化系数接近 1.0；系统性偏离提示模型的特定局限（如药物代谢差异、靶点表达差异）。</p>\n<p><strong>3R 原则与替代模型</strong>：Replacement（替代）、Reduction（减少）、Refinement（改善）仍是动物实验伦理的基石。类器官和 OoC 的发展正在为 Replacement 提供可行的技术路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一项新型 KRAS G12C 抑制剂需要在进入 FIH 之前选择最合适的临床前评价策略。比较以下三种方案的优劣：(a) KRAS G12C 突变细胞系药效学 + 小鼠异种移植，(b) 患者来源类器官药物敏感性测试，(c) PDX 共临床试验。讨论每种方案的信息产出、时间成本和转化预测效度。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个多器官芯片实验方案，评估一种新型抗体-药物偶联物（ADC）的肝毒性风险。明确需要串联的器官室（肿瘤-肝-骨髓）、流速参数的人体等效缩放方法，以及毒性终点的选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>FDA Modernization Act 2.0 允许用替代方法代替动物试验。讨论在何种情况下监管机构可能仍要求动物数据，以及申办方如何建立替代方法数据包的可信度。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某课题组建立了 50 株结直肠癌 PDX，并用 5 种标准化疗方案进行了药物反应测试。请设计一个分析流程，评估这组 PDX 的药物反应谱是否能代表临床中观察到的反应异质性，需要哪些临床数据作为参照。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Drost &amp; Clevers (2018)</strong>：<em>Organoids in cancer research</em>（Nature Reviews Cancer）— 类器官在肿瘤转化研究中的综述</li>\n<li><strong>Ingber (2022)</strong>：<em>Human organs-on-chips for disease modelling, drug development and personalized medicine</em>（Nature Reviews Genetics）— OoC 领域的权威综述</li>\n<li><strong>Gao et al. (2015)</strong>：<em>High-throughput screening using patient-derived tumor xenografts to predict clinical trial drug response</em>（Nature Medicine）— PDX 大规模筛药的里程碑研究</li>\n<li><strong>FDA Modernization Act 2.0</strong>（2022）— 允许替代方法的立法文本</li>\n<li><strong>NIH NCATS Tissue Chip Program</strong>：美国国家转化科学推进中心的器官芯片项目</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>临床前模型验证是转化研究成败的第一道关卡。从二维细胞系到类器官、器官芯片和 PDX 模型，各平台在生理相关性、通量和成本之间提供不同的权衡。&quot;Fit-for-purpose&quot;原则要求根据具体研究问题选择最具信息量的模型，而非追求最高复杂度。转化预测效度的量化评估和 FDA Modernization Act 2.0 的监管创新，正在重塑临床前研究的方法论标准和实践范式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士转化医学 — 临床前模型验证","id":"博士转化医学-临床前模型验证"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"类器官：架桥基础与临床","id":"类器官-架桥基础与临床"},{"level":3,"text":"器官芯片：工程化的生理模型","id":"器官芯片-工程化的生理模型"},{"level":3,"text":"患者来源异种移植（PDX）模型","id":"患者来源异种移植-pdx-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"转化预测效度的量化评估","id":"转化预测效度的量化评估"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"博士转化医学 — 首次人体试验","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/bench-to-bedside/first-in-human-studies"}}